OL,3,GNEWSAOxford's traffic filter trial:
OL,4,AYour questions answered
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn three weeks' time, Oxford's
OL,7,Ftemporary congestion charge will end
OL,8,Fand a traffic filter trial will begin.
OL,10,FSigns are going up and 340,000 leaflets
OL,11,Fare being delivered to households and
OL,12,Fbusinesses across the county.
OL,14,FTraffic filters were first approved by
OL,15,Fthe council in November 2022 following
OL,16,Fa public consultation. But what is the
OL,17,Ftrial designed to do and how will it
OL,18,Faffect people travelling into Oxford?
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
